Why use Microsoft Entra ID with AKS?
 Entra ID provides centralized identity, MFA, Conditional Access, auditing, lifecycle management, and integration with Azure governance.
Azure RBAC vs. Kubernetes RBAC
  Azure RBAC controls access to the cluster and integrating identities, while Kuberenetes RBAC controls permissions on objects within the cluster.
Why use namespaces?
  We used namespaces to isolate our development, testing, and production. Benefits of namespaces include easier security admininstration, organizing resources, segmentation,
  etc.
Why shouldn't developers be Cluster Admins?
  This goes against least privilege principles as they can escalate privileges, accidental deletions, access to secrets, reduced separations, increased attack surface, etc.
How does this support Zero Trust?
  Under this framework, every user must authenticate for access to these resources, they only receive the permissions necessary to do their job, and it is continuously 
  subjected to centralized governance and auditing.
